info.description:
This course provides knowledge for learners on modes of transport: sea, air, rail, road and Incoterms 2010 to know the transport rights of exporters (or importers);

Introduce how to calculate the costs related to the cost of renting the first transport, the attention when booking on ships and aircraft;

Brief introduction of existing shipping lines and airlines in Vietnam;

 Analysis of the nature of insurance as well as the risks and losses and the conditions for insurance of current import and export goods, insurance contracts, principles and procedures for purchasing insurance. Thereby knowing what to do to be compensated for loss and how to calculate compensation.
